# plans branch only (orphan) — never part of a code PR or upstream.
# The sync-main watcher rewrites this heartbeat file every 60s; it is
# machine-local liveness, not shared project state, so keep it out of git.
session/status/main.md

# Raw per-session capture written continuously by scripts/session-snapshot.sh, plus its
# marker. Regenerable from the session transcript, uncurated, and per-machine — it exists
# so panic recovery is reading a small file rather than parsing a large one. The distilled,
# committed artifact is the digest beside it.
session/digests/*.raw.md
session/digests/.*.mark
